# Smoke Testing Specification
#
# Smoke testing library for post-deployment verification. Runs critical
# health checks to ensure basic functionality works after deployment.
#
# Feature IDs: Testing Infrastructure - Deployment Verification
# Category: Testing
# Status: Planned
# Priority: Medium
#
# Key Concepts:
# - Smoke Test: Quick test of critical functionality
# - Retry Logic: Automatic retries for flaky tests
# - Fail Fast: Stop on first failure
# - Health Check: Verify service availability

# NOTE: No imports needed - describe/it/expect are built-in

use std.spec.step
describe "Smoke Testing":
    # Test suite for the smoke testing library.
    #
    # Tests cover:
    # - SmokeTestConfig: Default and custom configuration options
    # - SmokeTestSuite: Adding tests, running tests, collecting results
    # - Test execution: Pass/fail detection, timeout handling
    # - Retry logic: Automatic retries, delay between retries, early success detection
    # - Fail fast: Stopping on first failure or running all tests
    # - Result checking: Verifying all tests passed
    # - Real-world scenarios: HTTP health checks, database connectivity, API endpoints
    # - Reporting: Formatting pass/fail/timeout results with appropriate symbols
    # - Integration: Working with deployment pipelines and rollback on failure
    context "SmokeTestConfig":
